WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.200
Iden: Agent Hask, I'm in position.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.050
Hask: Understood, Commander. Prepare for extraction.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.010
Hask: Three, two, one.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.640
Iden: Agent Hask!

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.440
Hask: Commander on deck!

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:49.620
Iden: At ease.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.180
Hask: Mission accomplished, Commander.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.640
Iden: With zero casualties. Looks like you're still second-in-command.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.140
Hask: Oh, I'm patient. I can wait.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.900
Iden: Agent Meeko. Those jump calculations were perfect.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.120
Del: Thank you, ma'am. Hope the landing wasn't too rough.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:08.160
Iden: Been through worse. Remember the Ja-bess Incursion?

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.440
Del: Still haunts my dreams.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.240
Iden: Contact the Admiral.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.120
Hask: Yes, Commander. And the message?

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.340
Iden: The fleet's location is still safe.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.080
Iden: Today, the Rebellion dies.
